Package: scanbus-frontend
Architecture: any
Depends: 
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: GTK frontend for scanbus
 The graphical scanbus application for browsing scanners and launching scans.

Package: scanbus-backend
Architecture: any
Depends: 
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 sane-utils
Recommends: 
 hplip
Description: scanbus D-Bus service and command-line client
 A session-scoped D-Bus service for document scanners, installed with its
 user-level systemd unit, D-Bus activation file and stable scanimage helper.
